DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270413
DTSTAMP:20261116T020307Z
UID:D-0001@redletter.local
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
CATEGORIES:Redletter,first
DESCRIPTION:Vostok 1\, one orbit in 108 minutes. The first human being in 
 space\, and the first to return from it.\n\nHappened: 1961-04-12 (gregoria
 n calendar\, day precision)\nChecked against 2 sources\, 2 of 2 supporting
  the day.\n· Vostok 1 — Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vos
 tok_1\n· NASA history — remembering Yuri Gagarin 50 years later — htt
 ps://www.nasa.gov/history/remembering-yuri-gagarin-50-years-later/
